WEBVTT

26:02.045 --> 26:04.714
You're not. You're freezing.

26:16.893 --> 26:19.479
I don't like high places.

26:19.604 --> 26:23.441
You can't fight. You can't see.

26:23.567 --> 26:26.987
You're afraid of heights
and almost everything else probably.

26:28.446 --> 26:30.031
What are you doing here, Sam?
